message: "If you use this code, please cite the article in preferred-citation."
title: "StrokePE: permutation entropy analysis of stroke motor-imagery EEG"
type: software
version: 1.1.0
license: MIT
doi: 10.5281/zenodo.23559636
repository-code: "https://github.com/USERNAME/StrokePE"
abstract: >-
  Code accompanying Bose et al., Chaos 36, 063101 (2026). Permutation entropy of
  EEG from stroke patients performing left- and right-hand motor imagery is compared
  with healthy eye-open motor imagery and eye-closed resting state, using
  ordinal-pattern analysis within the Bandt-Pompe framework.
keywords:
  - permutation entropy
  - ordinal patterns
  - EEG
  - stroke
  - motor imagery
  - brain-computer interface
